## 🚀 Tech Stack

```
FRONTEND        → HTML5 + CSS3 + Vanilla JavaScript (ES6+)
ANIMATIONS      → GSAP 3 (GreenSock) + ScrollReveal.js
BUILD TOOL      → Parcel 2 (bundler + minifier + optimizer)
HOSTING         → Netlify (Free) — custom domain connected
DOMAIN          → Client purchases separately (~$10-15/yr)
REPORT STORAGE  → Google Drive (Free, 15GB shared)
REPORT INDEX    → Google Sheets (pseudo-database)
ADMIN PANEL     → Password-protected HTML page (staff only)
PACKAGE MANAGER → npm (only for dev tooling — no runtime deps)
FRAMEWORKS      → None (pure HTML/CSS/Vanilla JS)
COST/MONTH      → $0 (only annual domain cost)
```

### Why This Stack

- **Parcel**: Zero-config bundler. Minifies CSS/JS, optimizes images, handles imports. No webpack config. One command builds everything.
- **GSAP**: The industry-standard animation library. Powers hero text reveals, number counters, card entrances. CDN delivery → no bundle bloat.
- **ScrollReveal**: Lightweight scroll-triggered animations. Simply call `ScrollReveal().reveal('.element')`. No config complexity.
- **Google Sheets**: Free pseudo-database. Staff add rows. Site reads via public API. No backend needed.
- **Google Drive**: Free PDF storage. Direct download links. No file hosting costs.
- **Netlify**: Free hosting, SSL, custom domain, form handling. Deploy by drag-and-drop or Git.

### What This Stack Is NOT

- No React/Vue/Angular
- No Node.js server
- No PHP/Python backend
- No paid database (Supabase, Firebase, PlanetScale, etc.)
- No Bootstrap or Tailwind (custom CSS only)
- No jQuery

---

## ⚙️ Local Development

### First-Time Setup

```bash
# 1. Clone the repo
git clone https://github.com/your-org/ddse-website.git
cd ddse-website

# 2. Install dev dependencies (Parcel only — no runtime JS deps)
npm install

# 3. Copy config and fill in your values
cp config.example.js config.js
# Edit config.js with your Google API key, Sheet ID, etc.

# 4. Start dev server (hot reload)
npm run dev
```

### package.json

```json
{
  "name": "ddse-website",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "Official website for Dimension Digital Survey & Engineering",
  "scripts": {
    "dev": "parcel src/index.html src/about.html src/services.html src/team.html src/ceo.html src/reports.html src/gallery.html src/contact.html src/admin.html --open",
    "build": "parcel build src/index.html src/about.html src/services.html src/team.html src/ceo.html src/reports.html src/gallery.html src/contact.html src/admin.html --dist-dir dist",
    "clean": "rm -rf dist .parcel-cache"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "parcel": "^2.13.0"
  }
}
```

### .parcelrc

```json
{
  "extends": "@parcel/config-default",
  "transformers": {
    "*.{jpg,jpeg,png,gif,webp,svg}": ["@parcel/transformer-image"]
  }
}
```

### Recommended IDE Extensions

- **Live Server** (or use `npm run dev` with Parcel's built-in server)
- **Prettier** — consistent formatting
- **HTML CSS Support** — class name autocomplete

