## 🎨 Design System

### Design Philosophy

DDSE serves government clients, corporate contractors, and infrastructure firms. The site must project:

- **Precision** — sharp edges, clean grids, no clutter
- **Authority** — strong dark palette, structured hierarchy
- **Digital modernity** — gradients, glows, animated elements that feel cutting-edge but not playful
- **Trust** — clean typography, clear credentials display, professional imagery

**Benchmark feel:** Somewhere between a geospatial tech company (Esri, Trimble) and a premium Bangladesh engineering firm — not a startup landing page, not a government portal.

---

### 🎨 Color Palette — Modern Redesign

```css
:root {
  /* ─── Primary Brand ─── */
  --primary-900:   #030D1A;   /* Near-black navy — deepest bg */
  --primary-800:   #071A2E;   /* Hero section background */
  --primary-700:   #0D2744;   /* Navbar background */
  --primary-600:   #0F3460;   /* Section backgrounds, cards */
  --primary-500:   #1A4D7C;   /* Mid-tone for gradients */
  --primary-400:   #1E6091;   /* Hover states, borders */

  /* ─── Accent (Cyan-Electric) ─── */
  --accent:        #00C2FF;   /* Primary CTA, highlights, glows */
  --accent-dark:   #009BD6;   /* Hover on accent */
  --accent-muted:  #00C2FF26; /* Translucent version for bg use */
  --accent-glow:   0 0 24px rgba(0, 194, 255, 0.35); /* CSS shadow glow */

  /* ─── Secondary Accent (Emerald) ─── */
  --emerald:       #06D6A0;   /* Success, approved badges, geo feel */
  --emerald-dark:  #04A87D;   /* Hover on emerald */
  --emerald-muted: #06D6A018; /* Translucent emerald */

  /* ─── Warm Highlight ─── */
  --gold:          #F5A623;   /* Stats bar numbers, award badges */
  --gold-dark:     #D4891A;   /* Hover on gold */

  /* ─── Surface ─── */
  --surface:       #F0F5FA;   /* Page background (light mode sections) */
  --surface-card:  #FFFFFF;   /* Cards, modals */
  --surface-dark:  #071A2E;   /* Dark section background */
  --surface-mid:   #EBF2FA;   /* Alt section background */

  /* ─── Text ─── */
  --text-primary:   #0D1B2A;  /* Main body text (on light bg) */
  --text-secondary: #4A5568;  /* Muted/secondary text */
  --text-light:     #94A3B8;  /* Placeholder, captions */
  --text-inverse:   #F0F5FA;  /* Text on dark backgrounds */
  --text-accent:    #00C2FF;  /* Accent text (on dark bg) */

  /* ─── UI States ─── */
  --border:         #D0DCE8;  /* Borders on light sections */
  --border-dark:    #1A3A5C;  /* Borders on dark sections */
  --success:        #06D6A0;
  --error:          #EF4444;
  --warning:        #F5A623;
  --info:           #00C2FF;

  /* ─── Shadows ─── */
  --shadow-sm:  0 1px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
  --shadow-md:  0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.10);
  --shadow-lg:  0 8px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.14);
  --shadow-xl:  0 16px 64px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.20);
  --glow-accent: 0 0 32px rgba(0, 194, 255, 0.25);
  --glow-emerald: 0 0 24px rgba(6, 214, 160, 0.20);

  /* ─── Gradients ─── */
  --gradient-hero:    linear-gradient(135deg, #030D1A 0%, #0D2744 55%, #0F3460 100%);
  --gradient-section: linear-gradient(180deg, #071A2E 0%, #0D2744 100%);
  --gradient-card:    linear-gradient(145deg, #0F3460 0%, #1A4D7C 100%);
  --gradient-accent:  linear-gradient(135deg, #00C2FF 0%, #06D6A0 100%);
  --gradient-text:    linear-gradient(135deg, #00C2FF 0%, #06D6A0 100%); /* for CSS text gradient */

  /* ─── Border Radius ─── */
  --radius-sm:  6px;
  --radius-md:  12px;
  --radius-lg:  20px;
  --radius-xl:  32px;
  --radius-full: 9999px;

  /* ─── Spacing ─── */
  --space-xs:  4px;
  --space-sm:  8px;
  --space-md:  16px;
  --space-lg:  24px;
  --space-xl:  40px;
  --space-2xl: 64px;
  --space-3xl: 96px;
  --space-4xl: 128px;

  /* ─── Transitions ─── */
  --ease-smooth: cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
  --ease-spring: cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);
  --duration-fast: 200ms;
  --duration-normal: 350ms;
  --duration-slow: 600ms;
}
```

**Color usage rules:**
- Dark sections (Hero, Footer, Navbar): `--primary-800` / `--primary-700` background, `--text-inverse` text, `--accent` highlights
- Light sections (About, Services cards): `--surface` background, `--text-primary` text
- Alternate sections: `--surface-mid` background for visual rhythm
- CTA buttons: `--accent` background with `--primary-900` text
- Secondary buttons: transparent with `--accent` border + text
- Badges/approvals: `--emerald` color with `--emerald-muted` background
- Stats numbers: `--gold` color
- Never use raw hex values in CSS — always use variables

---

### Typography

```css
/* In <head> of every HTML file */
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&family=Syne:wght@600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

:root {
  --font-body:    'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
  --font-heading: 'Syne', 'Inter', sans-serif;    /* H1, H2 — bold, geometric */
  --font-mono:    'JetBrains Mono', monospace;    /* Report IDs, codes */
}
```

**Font usage:**
- `--font-heading` (Syne): H1, H2 only — gives modern, geometric engineering feel
- `--font-body` (Inter): All other text, subheadings, body, labels
- `--font-mono` (JetBrains Mono): Report IDs, technical codes, stat numbers

