## 🧩 Reusable Components

### Buttons

```html
<!-- Primary — Cyan filled -->
<a href="#" class="btn btn-primary">Our Services</a>

<!-- Secondary — Outline -->
<a href="#" class="btn btn-outline">Download Report</a>

<!-- Ghost — text only with arrow -->
<a href="#" class="btn btn-ghost">Learn More <span class="btn-arrow">→</span></a>

<!-- With icon -->
<a href="#" class="btn btn-primary">
  <svg class="btn-icon" ...></svg>
  Download Report
</a>
```

### Section Header

```html
<div class="section-header">
  <span class="section-tag">What We Do</span>
  <h2 class="section-title">Our Services</h2>
  <p class="section-subtitle">Professional survey solutions across Bangladesh</p>
</div>
```

### Service Card

```html
<div class="service-card">
  <div class="card-icon-wrap">
    <div class="card-icon"><!-- SVG icon --></div>
  </div>
  <div class="card-shine"></div> <!-- GSAP hover shine overlay -->
  <h3 class="card-title">Topographic Survey</h3>
  <p class="card-text">Precise digital topographic surveys for land, roads, bridges, canals, and drain layouts.</p>
  <a href="services.html#topographic" class="card-link">Learn More →</a>
</div>
```

### Alert / Message

```html
<div class="alert alert-success">
  <svg class="alert-icon"><!-- check icon --></svg>
  <div class="alert-content">
    <strong>Report Found</strong>
    <p>Your survey report is ready to download.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="alert alert-error">...</div>
