## 🔗 Google Integration

### config.js Template

```javascript
// config.js — GITIGNORED. Never commit real values.
const CONFIG = {
  GOOGLE_API_KEY:       "AIzaSy...",
  SHEETS_ID:            "1BxiMVs0XRA5nFMdKvBdBZjgmUUqptlbs74OgVE2upms",
  DRIVE_FOLDER_ID:      "1a2b3c4d5e6f...",
  GALLERY_FOLDER_ID:    "7g8h9i0j1k2l...",
  ADMIN_PASSWORD_HASH:  "a665a45920422f...",
  SHEET_NAME:           "Reports",
  SHEET_RANGE:          "Reports!A:I"
};
```

### Google Sheets Schema

| Col | Header | Format | Example |
|---|---|---|---|
| A | report_id | DDSE-YYYY-NNN | `DDSE-2024-001` |
| B | client_phone | 01XXXXXXXXX | `01712345678` |
| C | client_name | Full name | `Md. Karim Hossain` |
| D | survey_type | See list | `Topographic Survey` |
| E | location | Area, District | `Agailjhara, Barisal` |
| F | date | YYYY-MM-DD | `2024-11-15` |
| G | drive_file_id | Drive file ID | `1BxiMV...` |
| H | description | Brief description | `Land survey for plot no. 123` |
| I | status | active / inactive | `active` |

### Report Download Flow

```
Client: Report ID + Phone Number
  ↓
JS: fetch Google Sheets API (read-only public key)
  ↓
Find row: report_id match AND client_phone match AND status === 'active'
  ↓
Extract: drive_file_id
  ↓
Show: report details to client (name, type, location, date)
  ↓
Download URL: https://drive.google.com/uc?export=download&id={drive_file_id}
```

### Admin Upload Flow

```
Staff: admin.html → password → fills form → selects PDF
  ↓
JS: OAuth2 Google sign-in (company Gmail)
  ↓
Upload PDF to Google Drive (DDSE Reports folder)
  ↓
Append row to Google Sheets
  ↓
Show generated Report ID → staff gives to client
```

