## 📱 Responsive Behavior

| Element | Desktop (1024px+) | Tablet (768px) | Mobile (375px) |
|---|---|---|---|
| Navbar | Horizontal, all links | Horizontal, condensed | Hamburger → full overlay |
| Hero | Full height, side padding | Full height | 90vh, stacked CTAs |
| Service cards | 3 columns | 2 columns | 1 column |
| Team cards | 3–4 columns | 2 columns | 1 column |
| Staff table | Full table | Scroll table | Card per row |
| Stats bar | Horizontal row | 2×2 grid | 2×2 grid |
| Gallery | 3 columns masonry | 2 columns | 1 column |
| Footer | 4 columns | 2 columns | 1 column stacked |

